rise Oscar win that most people in Hollywood had entirely counted out. Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:30:01Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Also loved William Shatner quote after his space ride", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:30:08Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Lange", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:30:20Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Jessica", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:30:25Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "That's what she said", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:30:31Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Jessica Lange is correct. Born on this day in 1949", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:30:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Pavan 50 Sal 35 Nikhil 10 Lzafeer 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:30:58Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Why does she keep saying these things ?😬", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:17Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "I was waiting for your response warna mein bolne wala tha 😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:18Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Last", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:20Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "I don't know", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:31Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "she is trying to communicate", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:40Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "With her home planet maybe", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:42Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "I discovered that the beauty isn't out there, it's down here, with all of us. Leaving that behind made my connection to our tiny planet even more profound.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T17:31:44Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "11. This painting X is arguably the most important bridge between Y’s early life and his later surrealist style.\nIt is an incredibly meticulous, almost obsessive inventory of his family lands in Montroig. Y spent nine months on this single painting, obsessively detailing every single object—from the watering can to the rabbit hutch.\nThe author Z famously bought this painting as a birthday present for his wife, Hadley, after the old man was done searching through Paris for the \"perfect\" gift. He kept it for the rest of his life, claiming it contained \"all that you feel about Spain when you are away.\" It represents the very last time Y would attempt to paint reality with photographic accuracy. The painting now rests at National Gallery of Art in Washington DC. Id X, Y and Z.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]